==Strategy==
Super Metal Hippoe is the real boss of this stage. Don't even try this stage without any [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical hitters]]. Doing [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] draws can provide you with either [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]] or [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]]/[[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Floating]] units that can beat [[Attack on R-Cyclone (Expert)|Crimson Catastrophe]], which drops [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]].

Critical Hitters aside, all you need is a generalist lineup with a few meatshields and strong yet spammable [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]] to deal with the Crazed Fish.

